	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"Mob Grinding Utils adds a wide range of tools designed to enhance and customize mob farms. It includes Entity Fans for precisely moving mobs, Tinted Glass that’s tough enough to withstand the Wither, and the Mob Masher, a fully upgradeable mob grinder with enhancements like Looting, Fire Aspect, and more."
				""
				"Many of the mod’s recipes require Steel, making it a great mid-game addition to any automation or resource farming setup."
				""
				"{\"text\":\"Note that you cannot move vanilla mob spawners using Create. For mob farms, use the \",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"Mechanical Spawner.\",\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2DC29EE22186BDB7\"},\"color\":\"blue\",\"underlined\":true}]}"
			]
			icon: {
